      en: ["The valley is located roughly 140 kilometers northwest of Hanoi.", "The majority of the population belongs to the White Thai ethnic group.", "Traditional stilt houses are elevated 1.5 to 2 meters above ground.", "Mai Chau sits at an average elevation of 200 to 300 meters.", "The villages of Lac and Poom Coong are over 700 years old.", "Rice harvests in the valley typically occur in May and October."],
