      en: ["The Phu Yen coastline extends for approximately 189 kilometers.", "Ganh Da Dia features over 35,000 interlocking basalt columns.", "The lighthouse at Cape Dai Lanh was first established in 1890.", "O Loan Lagoon spans a total area of 1,200 hectares.", "Vung Ro Bay was the site of a major naval blockade in 1965.", "The province's coast is punctuated by more than 20 small bays."],
      es: ["Un litoral pintoresco y diverso con formaciones geológicas únicas como Gành Đá Đĩa, largas playas de arena y bahías tranquilas.", "Situado en el territorio de la República Socialista de Vietnam.", "Desempeña un papel en la identidad local de la región."],
